@startuml sequence_review_trend
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Review Trend Request

participant Client as C
participant GoalProgressController as Ctrl
participant GetGoalProgressTrendHandler as H
database "SQL Server" as DB

C -> Ctrl: GET /trend?goalId=17&asOf=2026-03-15&windowDays=30
Ctrl -> Ctrl: parse asOf (UTC EOD), validate
Ctrl -> H: send(query)
H -> DB: window CTE ending at 2026-03-15
DB --> H: 30 rows
H --> Ctrl: GoalTrendDto (Mode='review')
Ctrl -> Ctrl: asOf older than 1m -> Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
Ctrl --> C: 200 OK

@enduml
